---
// AboutHero component for the About page
---

<section class="about-hero">
  <div class="hero-background">
    <!-- Background patterns -->
    <div class="pattern pattern-1"></div>
    <div class="pattern pattern-2"></div>
    <div class="pattern pattern-3"></div>
    <div class="texture-overlay"></div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="main-content">
        <div class="title-section">
          <div class="top-subtitle">
            <span class="subtitle-text">Transparent & Honest</span>
            <div class="subtitle-line"></div>
          </div>
          <h1 class="main-title">Why Resolved : Trust</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content-text">
          <p>Trust is a rare commodity these days. For those seeking legal advice, trust in your attorney is sometimes a luxury ill-afforded. Far too many people come to us complaining attorneys prioritize dollars over people, artificially racking up bills with frivolous motions and delays. Or, by nickel and dime-ing administrative work. These moves are often disguised as "fighting till the end" and "exploring every possibility". Sometimes, it's simply the attorney only telling the client what that attorney thinks the client wants to hear. We've witnessed this behavior time and again. Trust us, we find these practices gross.</p>
          
          <p>&nbsp;</p>
          
          <p>This status quo is the reason Resolved Law Group was created. Nobody wants to be in a legal battle. All the uncertainties that come with not knowing what's next can bleed into and poison every facet of your life. Delaying addressing these issues only makes matters worse, and you should always trust your attorney is being upfront with you. Let's get it done--compassionately, efficiently, affordably; get your legal issues Resolved.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="cta-section">
          <a href="/practice-areas" class="cta-button">
            Legal Expertise / Services
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="hero-image">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <div class="placeholder-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
              <path d="M12 2L13.09 8.26L20 9L13.09 9.74L12 16L10.91 9.74L4 9L10.91 8.26L12 2Z" fill="currentColor"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="placeholder-text">Photo with Resolved Law Group Team</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    background-color: var(--secondary-background);
    min-height: 900px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-background {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .pattern {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 25px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .pattern-1 {
    top: -144px;
    right: 0;
    width: 480px;
    height: 480px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 199, 129, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .pattern-2 {
    top: 591px;
    left: -240px;
    width: 480px;
    height: 480px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 199, 129, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .pattern-3 {
    top: -144px;
    right: 0;
    width: 480px;
    height: 480px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 199, 129, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .texture-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255, 199, 129, 0.05) 50%, transparent 100%);
    mix-blend-mode: soft-light;
    opacity: 0.2;
  }

  .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: var(--container-max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--container-padding);
  }

  .hero-content {
    display: flex;
    gap: 138px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .main-content {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 604px;
  }

  .title-section {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .top-subtitle {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .subtitle-text {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--main-accent-light);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .subtitle-line {
    width: 163px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--main-accent-light);
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .main-title {
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--light-text);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .content-text {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--light-text);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .content-text p {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .cta-section {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--sunset);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--main-content);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background-color: var(--main-accent-light);
    color: var(--main-content);
  }

  .hero-image {
    flex: 0 0 498px;
    height: 600px;
  }

  .image-placeholder {
    background-color: var(--main-content);
    border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px 0px var(--secondary-background);
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .placeholder-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--light-text);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .placeholder-text {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    font-size: 50px;
    color: var(--light-text);
    opacity: 0.2;
    text-align: center;
    width: 420px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1440px) {
    .container {
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }
    
    .hero-content {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .main-title {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .hero-image {
      flex: none;
      height: 300px;
    }
    
    .main-title {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
    
    .placeholder-text {
      font-size: 24px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
